{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>FridgeLoop 是一款智能食材管理 App，適合想減少浪費、掌握雪櫃與儲物櫃存貨及尋找食譜的用家。它可透過掃描購物收據自動記錄食材與到期日，並提供保鮮提醒和現有食材食譜建議；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-261.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描收據自動管理食材</h2>\n<p>拍照掃描購物收據後，FridgeLoop 會自動整理食材並估算到期日，亦會在食物變壞前提醒。你可追蹤雪櫃與儲物櫃存貨，並以現有食材尋找食譜靈感；存貨、食譜及購物紀錄會在多部裝置保持同步，另可查看食材使用情況、浪費與購物開支分析。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-192-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-193-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-194-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-195-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-196-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-197-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：FridgeLoop: Food Inventory</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fridgeloop-food-inventory/id6747889300?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:04:20.883611+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T22:42:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T21:37:56.986338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T22:57:45.359514+00:00","content_hash":"1a24128d55ccd187c957667a982c7be42bfa563a34ce4aedb34ba345a24dd9fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}